WEBVTT

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.880
The amount of the terrible gas called Destron Gas

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.210
which destroys all living cellular tissues, is increasing on Earth.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:48.020
In order to stop that Destron Gas, Dende asked

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:52.870
Goku for help, telling him to destroy the generators of the gas.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:25.350
Goku and the others were able to destroy all the generators, except the last one.

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:48.730
Then North Kaioh-sama

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.400
informed Goku that this last generator was protected by a barrier created

00:01:53.720 --> 00:02:03.320
by a Tsufuru-Jin scientist whose planet had been conquered by the Saiya-Jins.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:13.350
Dr. Raichi was trying to destroy the Earth to take revenge on the Saiya-Jins.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:17.960
Having understood that the cause of bad was in the space,

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.490
Goku and the others obtained in the Bunbuku Island

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:28.240
a jewel called Gekinmun to build a spaceship.

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:34.560
Shortly after, they started to travel to the Dark Planet to defeat Dr. Raichi.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.120
That looks like the Dark Planet

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.200
What is that?

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.810
What's going on?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:25.230
Goku and gang managed to sedate the space storm and reach the Dark Planet with the help of Kaioh through correspondance

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:32.230
Having arrived at the Dark Planet

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:38.190
they were informed that Dr. Raichi was at the Control Center of the Evil Castle.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.280
Soon after they proceeded their way.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:47.410
I won't let you go where Master Raichi is!
This is going to be your graveyard.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:24.420
We don't have too much time now.
We have to find Dr. Raichi.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:25.600
Kakarotto...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:33.210
I'll let you take care of the small fry,
but remember, I am going to kill Dr. Raichi!

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.580
Son Goku, please hurry!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:18.400
What a spacious room!

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.260
What's that?

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:01.950
Dr. Raichi! You have to be in here!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.230
Show yourself!

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:12.410
Saiyans welcome!

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:17.450
I never thought you would make it here!
I will congratulate you on that!

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.540
Yes, I am Dr. Raichi

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:26.880
and just as I had planned, the last surviving Saiyans came here all together!

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:33.210
This must be suggesting the fact that Saiya-Jins have little understanding about anything but fighting.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:34.810
What?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.180
You must be Prince Vegeta!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:43.130
You will soon feel the rage toward your father, King Vegeta.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.640
I will take revenge on you to my heart's content.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.200
Try if you can!

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.500
Now is the time for revenge.

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:06.560
We have waited for this moment for such a long time...

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:13.990
Take pleasure Tsufuru-Jins who were exterminated by Saiya-Jins

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.660
Us Tsufuru-Jins tried to help the Saiya-Jins

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.380
and all they gave us in return was death and destruction.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:30.240
I will never forgive Saiya-Jins for what they did to us, even if God does!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.200
What are you talking about?

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.640
You treated the ancestors of us Saiyans just like slaves!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:41.080
You Tsufuru-Jins are the unforgiven race!

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:48.700
Just like the saying goes "Robbers have their own reasoning".

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.020
If I look back it was a very long time ago...

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:01.240
Overwhelmed in the fight with Saiya-Jins,
Tsufuru-Jins were in the danger of the complete exterminaton.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:05.490
In the middle of the chaos, I as the best scientist among Tsufuru-Jins...

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.220
completed Hatchhyack, a machine which amplifies the energy of spite

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.850
It was the ultimate creation

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:15.950
with which I could gather and amplify the energy of hatred inside of us Tsufuru-Jins,

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:22.560
have it evolved into a living creature on its own
and create many ghost warriors.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:26.660
It would be the ultimate machine that could destroy the Saiya-Jins.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:34.910
But I needed time to let Hatchhyack collect the energy of hate.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:39.180
The Saiyans finally inched close to me.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:45.290
I tried to run on a space ship with Hatchhyack...

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.930
But right before the launching, I... I was...

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:55.040
It's such a shame when I think about it even now... I was killed by a Saiyan!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:05.510
The space ship was launched from the Planet Vegeta,

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.750
with my intense spite toward Saiya-Jins.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.580
The ship soft-landed in the graveyard of the space.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:17.860
Hatchhyack continued to evolve itself into a living creature

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:28.430
Freeza and those others who attacked you

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:33.150
were all ghost warriors that Hatchhyack created.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.600
That means you are ghost warrior too.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:43.530
Yes. I am the ultimate ghost warrior that Hatchhyack has created!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:50.820
It's finally time to see my dream come true, to destroy all Saiya-Jins!

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:54.200
I've finally won!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:16.880
You won't be able to break this barrier with your power.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.010
I will make you ghosts just like us!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.470
It's true that Saiyans had done bad things

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.060
but your hatred toward the Saiya-Jins is unreasonable.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:39.610
You can't kill everything on Earth with that Destron Gas!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.200
The Earth has nothing to do with this!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:47.930
Shut up! Don't talk as if you understand something, Saiyan!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.130
I am not a Saiyan! I am an Earthling!!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:58.200
I could care less about the Earthlings as long as I can get rid of the Saiyans!

00:11:58.730 --> 00:11:59.980
What did you say?

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:04.490
I will take whatever measures available to get rid of Saiya-Jins!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:12.210
I am an Earthling! I won't let you destroy the Earth!!!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:51.270
Kamehame...

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:54.270
Kakarotto! Dr. Raichi is mine!

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.970
...Ha!

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:08.140
Damn you Saiyans!

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.170
Final Flash!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:18.020
Damn Saiya-Jins!!! Damn you...

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.960
This is what you get for your foolish behavior.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.640
A Tsufuru rebelling against Saiyans!?

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.920
What a guy!

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:39.610
I didn't know that it could get this bad when hate gathers together.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.280
Poor man...

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:48.570
with all of this scientific knowledge, all he could think about was revenge.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:09.190
The last generator of Destron Gas has disappeared from the Earth! Great job!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:12.530
The Earth is fine now and peace has been restored!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:16.620
Really? Cool!!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.760
We are ghost warriors.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.500
As long as we keep the hate, as long as there is Hatchhyack,

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:02.060
we can come back as many times as we want!

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.050
What?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.900
Go to the hell!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:21.220
Damn Saiya-Jins! Damn Saiya-Jins!!

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:43.770
Damn Saiya-Jins!! Damn Saiya-Jins!! Damn Saiya-Jins!!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.610
Raichi...

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.640
Saiya-Jins...

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.240
Kill...

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.700
Oh no... I have never felt such a great Ki!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:25.100
I hope it's not...

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.990
Dad!

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:43.390
Kaioh-sama, please tell me what's going?

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.620
Goku, we are in trouble...

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:52.390
Hatchhyack just collected the energy of spite from Dr. Raichi

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:58.790
and it was so strong that it went beyond the limit of its own capacity.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.250
Beyond the limit?

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:03.710
If Hatchhyack starts to roam space at its own will,

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.080
it will be the end of the Universe.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.390
What?!

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.410
It's all because of that Hatchhyack.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.140
We have to get rid of it!!

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:20.580
There is no other way but to destroy that Hatchhyack!!

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:30.750
Now it's getting a little more interesting...

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.190
What is that?!?

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.440
Vegeta!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.560
Damn monster!!

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:24.620
Take this!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:27.020
Final Flash!

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:42.180
Th... That's impossible!

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:56.900
Vegeta! Move!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.180
Father!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.300
Fa... Father!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:31.820
Dad!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.800
Pi... Piccolo san!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.950
Move!! Trunks! Gohan!

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:02.590
His power might be greater than Broly!! But...

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:24.850
15!!

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.190
Damn freak!!

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:13.560
Go... Gohan... eat this... Senzu.

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:18.290
Piccolo san!

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:21.130
Go... Gohan...

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:26.330
Piccolo san! Piccolo san!!

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:37.380
Gohan... there are three more Senzus... give them to the others...

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:39.730
You too Piccolo san!

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:45.450
Give them to the others! I'll be fine.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:52.420
Piccolo san, thank you.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:21.730
Gohan, I am sorry.

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:24.320
This is from Piccolo san.

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:27.100
I see.

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:29.270
Vegeta!

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:11.150
We must save Earth!!

00:24:18.690 --> 00:24:22.140
Now is our chance! Vegeta! Trunks! Gohan!
Get out of the way!

00:24:22.180 --> 00:24:26.450
Damn! A Saiyan will never be beaten by a Tsufuru!!

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:32.910
Goku san!

00:24:34.160 --> 00:24:34.800
Dad!

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:36.290
Please...

00:24:50.740 --> 00:24:51.930
Shoot!!!

00:24:52.480 --> 00:24:54.780
Kamehame-Ha!!

00:26:26.970 --> 00:26:29.000
Goku, you did a great job!

00:26:30.560 --> 00:26:34.620
Thanks to the remarkable activity by Z team, the greens on Earth came back.

00:26:35.220 --> 00:26:39.950
All life on Earth are now living to their fullest.

00:26:41.020 --> 00:26:43.750
Goku san! Gohan san!

00:26:44.720 --> 00:26:46.780
How long are you going to keep me waiting?! Dinner is ready!

00:26:46.830 --> 00:26:48.730
Come back NOW!
